4,1,,status,Jonathan,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,The current state of the break room is inefficient. We need a defined purpose to avoid the current ambiguity of use.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. It feels as though we are avoiding each other because we have no dedicated space for meaningful interaction.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"It's a mess, honestly. Someone always ends up cleaning or walking too far. We need to see where the time is going.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be rational. We are likely wasting money and effort. I want to see the actual figures before we commit to a change.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,Peace is essential for a productive mind. The noise and clutter from that room affect us all. Let us look at the facts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I suggest we look into the usage patterns and the cleaning history to see who is actually using the space.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am interested in how we communicate now and where our difficult conversations are actually taking place.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I want to know about the time spent on lunches and the actual labor involved in upkeep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the external costs. We should check the hire invoices and the fit-out quotes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I will investigate the physical environment, specifically the wall and the facilities callouts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,That covers the main points. Let's ensure we have a full picture of the logistics.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. It is better to decide based on evidence than on a whim.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,Just make sure we don't ignore the daily grind of the staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Naturally. Data doesn't lie, unlike our current ""first-come, first-served"" system.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,A wise approach. Let us gather our findings.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
